# SHA-256 of the DeltaTor Windows code-signing certificate (DER bytes,
# 64 hex characters on one line, colons optional).
#
# The release workflow fails closed until a real digest is present here: it
# signs DeltaTor.exe + hev-socks5-tunnel.dll, reads the signer certificate
# back out of the shipped exe, and prints the actual digest into the step
# summary of the first signing run. Paste that value onto the line below
# (comments and formatting are tolerated: the first 64-hex run wins, same
# rules as Android/release-signing-cert.sha256) and rerun.
#
# Until WINDOWS_CERT_BASE64 / WINDOWS_CERT_PASSWORD secrets exist, no
# release run gets this far — decode fails earlier, on purpose.
